The audit is complete. I’m writing the consolidated report now; it will preserve the reviewers’ valid objections but explicitly reject their own category errors—especially treating feeds as “central phantomatics,” treating current chatbots as Lem’s full human-producing phantomat, and treating a live philosophical rival as proof that Lem was wrong.
